{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03361","headline":"发藤州 · 宋之问","name":"发藤州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝夕苦遄征，孤魂长自惊。\n泛舟依雁渚，投馆听猿鸣。\n石发缘溪蔓，林衣埽地轻。\n云峰刻不似，苔藓画难成。\n露裛千花气，泉和万籁声。\n攀幽红处歇，跻险绿中行。\n恋切芝兰砌，悲缠松柏茔。\n丹心江北死，白发岭南生。\n魑魅天边国，穷愁海上城。\n劳歌意无限，今日爲谁明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03361.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03361","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}